# Local development needs no secrets.
#
# The simulated D1 store used by `npm run dev` (wrangler dev) is local and
# requires no credentials. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` only if you later add
# Worker secrets for local iteration:
#
#   cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
#
# Production deploys do not use this file. The deploy job authenticates with
# the CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN and CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID CI secrets.
